{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1c3e5f7-2b4d-4f6a-8c0e-1a3b5c7d9e0f",
    "name": "IT Install Kit Service - Kit Suite",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "E2E Postman suite for the IT Install Kit Service Domain (BIAN-aligned, ADR-001/005/013/019/030). Registers a kit (system, language, machine class: no machine, no secret), reads and lists it, updates it (the revision goes up), reads the stick definition, records install reports (the kit revision that ran is stored), retires and reinstates it and reads its ledger. Then proves the service is staff only and covers the negative guarantees with RFC 7807 error_code assertions. It files everything under its own generated tenant id (iktOrganisationId)."
  },
